<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Liz Claiborne said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Liz Claiborne said upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Susan Sansbury has raised her rating for Liz Claiborne Inc to attractive from neutral, a source at the brokerage said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sansbury was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the New York women's apparel maker closed Thursday at 44-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
